  "definition_projection": [
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s1-n34/lesson.json",
      "block": 12,
      "text": "一般地，如果函数 $f$ 的自变量在集合 $M$ 上取较大的值时，对应的函数值也较大，就说函数 $f$ 在集合 $M$ 上是增函数.",
      "source_refs": ["p0216#2"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s1-n34/lesson.json",
      "block": 14,
      "text": "一般地，如果函数 $f$ 的自变量在集合 $M$ 上取较大的值时，对应的函数值反而较小，就说函数 $f$ 在集合 $M$ 上是减函数.",
      "source_refs": ["p0216#4"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s1-n34/lesson.json",
      "block": 15,
      "text": "如果在整个定义域上函数 $f$ 总是增大（或者减小），那么就说，$f$ 是增函数（或者减函数）.",
      "source_refs": ["p0216#5"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s1-n31/lesson.json",
      "block": 0,
      "text": "根据算术平方根的定义，根式$\\sqrt{a}$（$a>0$）的值是非负数，它的平方等于$a$. 因此，对于任何非负数$a$来说，下列等式成立：",
      "source_refs": ["p0205#4"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s1-n31/lesson.json",
      "block": 1,
      "text": "$(\\sqrt{a})^2=a$. （1）",
      "source_refs": ["p0205#5"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s2-n36/lesson.json",
      "block": 0,
      "text": "我们来讨论根式 $\\sqrt{x^2}$。\n这个根式的定义域是实数集，因为对于任何 $x$ 来说，$x^2$ 的值都不是负数。",
      "source_refs": ["p0223#3"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s2-n36/lesson.json",
      "block": 1,
      "text": "由平方根的定义得出，当 $x$ 取任何非负值时，根式 $\\sqrt{x^2}$ 等于 $x$，就是说，当 $x\\geq 0$ 时，等式 $\\sqrt{x^2}=x$ 成立。",
      "source_refs": ["p0223#4"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s2-n36/lesson.json",
      "block": 3,
      "text": "当 $x$ 取任何一个负值时，根式 $\\sqrt{x^2}$ 的值是 $x$ 的相反数，就是说，当 $x<0$ 时，等式 $\\sqrt{x^2}=-x$ 成立。",
      "source_refs": ["p0223#6"]
    },
    {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/editions/modern-us-neutral/lessons/alg7-c4-s2-n36/lesson.json",
      "block": 5,
      "text": "可以看出，不管 $x$ 取什么值，根式 $\\sqrt{x^2}$ 的值和 $|x|$ 的值相同。\n实际上，如果 $x\\geq 0$，那么 $|x|=x$；\n如果 $x<0$，那么$|x|=-x$。\n\n就是说，等式$\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$ (1)在所有数的集合上是一个恒等式。",
      "source_refs": ["p0223#8"]
    }
  ],
  "conventions": {
    "number_system": "Real numbers, supported by the relevant n36 lesson prose.",
    "arithmetic_square_root": "Nonnegative root, including sqrt(0)=0; negative radicands undefined over the reals.",
    "strict_increase": "For every u,v in M, u<v implies f(u)<f(v).",
    "strict_decrease": "For every u,v in M, u<v implies g(u)>g(v).",
